# Tip Tap Games — optional AI game designer.
#
# With none of these set, /api/generate falls back to a local designer that
# matches your prompt against all 100 engines. The Make button works either
# way; the model just writes better titles, palettes and blurbs.
#
# Pick ONE of the two paths below.

# --- Free path: DeepSeek via OpenRouter -------------------------------------
# Sign in at openrouter.ai, create a key, and use a model whose id ends in
# ":free". No card needed for the free tier; it is rate limited, not billed.
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# Optional. Defaults to deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3-0324:free
# DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek/deepseek-chat-v3-0324:free
# Optional. Sent as the OpenRouter referer header.
# PUBLIC_URL=https://your-deployment.vercel.app

# --- Paid path: DeepSeek direct ---------------------------------------------
# platform.deepseek.com. Takes priority only if OPENROUTER_API_KEY is unset.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# Optional. Any OpenAI-compatible host works — point this at a local
# llama.cpp/Ollama/vLLM server and set DEEPSEEK_MODEL to match.
# DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
# DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-chat
